Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 02:44:46 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 5/7] lector sim: X4 Pro I2C (GT911 touch, CW2017, PCF8563),
 SDMMC read-back, event-warped light sleep

- esp32_i2c: C3/S3 opcode map and 8 command slots, wired as S3 I2C0
- lector_i2c.c: i2c-regs register-file chip and gt911 with QOM touch
- dwc_sdmmc: keep unhandled registers, card present and writable
- S3 RTC: light sleep jumps the virtual clock from event to event, paced
  to the wall clock; GPIO light-sleep wake; ticks survive recalibration
